{{For|the Trick or Treater on {{Gamemode|Stranded}}|Trick or Treater (Stranded)}}
'''Trick or Treater''' is a [[Spooky Mobs|Spooky Mob]] that spawns during [[Spooky Festival]]s.

== Spawning ==
Trick or Treaters can spawn in the {{Zone|Graveyard}}, {{Zone|Wilderness}}, {{Zone|Spider's Den}} and {{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}} at night during a [[Spooky Festival]]. They have a {{Green|3.06%}} chance to be spawned from a [[Trick or Treat Chest]].

== Behavior ==
Trick or Treaters will run quickly and try to attack the player dealing {{Stat|dmg|50}}. They have {{Stat|hp|10}}, and like all other Spooky Mobs, they take only {{Stat|Damage|1}} per hit, which can be increased with items like the [[Ghoul Buster]] and the [[Bat Pet]]. 

